{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0023_1000_046rio", "source_sha256": "4034a3bfdfd50f6948f758bd39c5838eecb012f64e12f99b6f450ad94aef606d", "ja": "はぁ……♪　楽しかったわね、今回のロケ。\n大切な思い出って、まだまだ増えるものなのね。", "zh": "哇……♪这次出外景真让人开心。\n珍贵的回忆真是越来越多了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0023_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "4fd06c52dac5248385dfd235ae00582215745f7bfa39f6cccd0b9b7f80242623", "ja": "やだ。お仕事なのに楽しかったとか、\nあんまり言っちゃダメだったかしら？", "zh": "不好，明明在工作却说很开心，\n这种话讲出来好像不太好喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0023_1002_p", "source_sha256": "75a719effaf2820a24c440049302b70e625965f85e9e324afb5365af6113c997", "ja": "でも、莉緒はずっと仕事してたんだし。\nその上でそういう感想が出るのは、いいことだよ。", "zh": "不过，莉绪不是一直都在工作吗？\n在这种情况下还能有那样的感想，是好事喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0023_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "036c3ae62d1b45f90b0c8b2452c38412be167e58ad6d15bf9723973ac8a0759e", "ja": "ずっとって……ウフフ。\nキミ、そんなに私のことばっかり見てくれてたの？", "zh": "你说一直……呵呵。\n你呀，该不会真的一直紧盯着我不放吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0023_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6a0c4b0c64c9c5f0b67387134d8894cdf16842124bf6a3d6a135a14ec33928bb", "ja": "あ、いや！　そういうわけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "啊，不是！我不是这个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0023_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "1038edd871d79d1681f79133fdbe8eddf3ab3236b5345d23c917a72d3d2b3c4c", "ja": "ウフフ、冗談よ冗談。アイドルをちゃんと見守るのが、\n{$P$}くんのお仕事だもんね。", "zh": "呵呵，开玩笑的啦。毕竟好好看着偶像，\n是{$P$}的工作啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0023_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "3cfe32fa3514f030ee5554546e272893567c48ea82a4ad8419171fe17b097000", "ja": "それがお仕事でも、キミの視線を独り占めできるのは、\nちょっと嬉しいかな……なんて♪　それに……。", "zh": "就算只是工作，但能够独占你的视线，\n我还是挺开心的……说笑的♪而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0023_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "c221c9fd9f98aaa3f7119d697edf6ec360fa31a9282fb87f0e9a79424ca0eee0", "ja": "お仕事が楽しいのは、{$P$}くんが\n一緒だからよ？　キミとなら、何でもできる気がする。", "zh": "工作之所以开心，是因为和{$P$}\n在一起喔？只要和你在一起，我觉得自己什么都办得到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0023_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0bac416ed38d70c52c2d3cfd36ea295cc3703ae91948a65173af0f09ddf43da0", "ja": "莉緒……。", "zh": "莉绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0023_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "aacf960aefb65436b76c99da6a09ed421945c8acd0413388f53fb0d7098a053c", "ja": "ホント、不思議よね。\nトップアイドルだって、全然夢じゃないって思えるの。", "zh": "真的很不可思议呢。我甚至觉得，\n当上顶尖偶像也不再是遥远的梦想了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0023_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "bcfe8ebb87168b628ce69c279273e4f01875485dd07060d5ceb993b42f399531", "ja": "トップアイドルになったら……これからもずっと、\n私がキミの視線を独占しちゃうかもね？　ウフフ♪", "zh": "要是当上顶尖偶像的话，说不定……\n今后我也能一直独占你的视线喔？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
